{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026568LXcGG2s1793226321.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報美國已通知多個海灣國家，在美國中期選舉後應對一場可能短暫、但激烈的軍事行動。美國總統特朗普又表示，與伊朗的戰事將按照他的條件結束。原油期貨價格上升。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報102.78美元一桶，升2.88美元，升幅近百分之2.9。倫敦期油收市報115.32美元一桶，升1.44美元仙，升幅百分之1.2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:00:44.054973+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T23:58:07.639667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T22:58:12.550630+00:00","content_hash":"06641821f90293fbd2dec80cb946ab839537fc0330073a9b3245aeb800c14db7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:00:44.054973+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}